WEBVTT

00:18:23.671 --> 00:18:30.155
Pa uzmite dvije
kamene pločice, i urežite u njih.

00:18:31.057 --> 00:18:35.427
Na jednu, urežite:
"Problemi su rješivi"

00:18:35.763 --> 00:18:39.944
A na drugu, urežite:
"Problemi su neizbježni"

00:18:40.396 --> 00:18:41.555
Hvala vam.

00:18:41.579 --> 00:18:42.729
(Pljesak)